<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Haggar cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Haggar cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday it had cut its rating for Haggar Corp to intermediate-term neutral from intermediate-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The company's long-term accumulate rating was maintained.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Dallas menswear maker closed on Friday at 14-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
